'''''When the Sacred Ginmill Closes''''' is a [[Trailblaze Mission]] in the chapter [[Cat Among Pigeons]].

==Steps==
# Inquire at the reception
# (Optional) Talk to Topaz
# Ask the Bloodhounds for clues
# Head to Dream's Edge to find Gallagher
# Find Gallagher at the Dream's Edge
# Use the clockwork on the principled Bloodhound Family member
# Talk to Gallagher

