===Ask the Bloodhounds for clues{{subst:void|<!--103120104-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Careless Bloodhound Family Member)
:'''Careless Bloodhound Family Member:''' We're carrying out our Captain's orders! Wh&mdash;What do you want!
::'''Composed Bloodhound Family Member:''' We made a mistake last time, and we're working hard to rectify it now. We don't have time for anything else! Surveilling the IPC Executive Topaz, ensuring that she stays put at The Reverie hotel during her time on Penacony... We've got the right one this time!
::'''(Trailblazer):''' (...So that's it, they were the pair who were after Firefly at the time.)
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Remember me?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We meet again.
::'''Composed Bloodhound Family Member:''' ...
::'''Careless Bloodhound Family Member:''' I&mdash;It's you again... Back for more trouble? We're not afraid of you this time!
::'''Composed Bloodhound Family Member:''' Well? Spit it out! Stop bothering us if you've nothing important!
::'''March 7th:''' So you know each other... (Trailblazer), why do you keep running into people you've beaten up before?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I've got business with your Captain. Where is he?
:::'''March 7th:''' That's right. We're investigating a murder for The Family. Can we speak to your Captain about the case?
:::I need you to pull some records for me. It's for official business.
:::'''March 7th:''' That's right. We're investigating a murder for The Family. May we access the hotel's Dreampool entry records?
:::When's our lunch break? Mmm... Hungwy.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} I need you to pull some records for me. It's for official business.
:::'''March 7th:''' That's right. We're investigating a murder for The Family. May we access the hotel's Dreampool entry records?
:::When's our lunch break? Mmm... Hungwy.
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} When's our lunch break? Mmm... Hungwy.
::'''March 7th:''' Sheesh, why do you keep asking me that? We're in the middle of investigating a murder case for The Family. May we speak to your Captain about it?
::'''Careless Bloodhound Family Member:''' Well...
::{{tx}}
:'''Composed Bloodhound Family Member:''' W&mdash;We have nothing to report. Please leave.
{{Dialogue End}}

===Head to Dream's Edge to find Gallagher{{subst:void|<!--103120105-->}}===
{{Mission Description|type=trailblaze|location=Dream's Edge|update|You learn that Gallagher is currently at the Dream's Edge from some blabbing Bloodhound members. Coincidentally, you had an encounter with Gallagher before. You might be able to access the investigation scene set up by the Bloodhounds by showing your face to Gallagher and glean more information about the cases from him.}}
{{Dialogue Start}}
:'''March 7th:''' Such tight security... I bet they're stumped by the case as well.
:'''March 7th:''' Gallagher... Gallagher... Where could he be?

;(Talk to Gallagher)
:'''Gallagher:''' I was wondering what all the commotion was... Oh, it's you guys. Welcome. Since you made it here, what can I do for you?
:'''Himeko:''' Hello, Mr. Gallagher, sir. Judging from your tone, it sounds like you were expecting us.
:'''Gallagher:''' Hahaha... Miss Himeko, you're too polite. There's no need to call me "Sir."
:'''Himeko:''' ...Mr. Gallagher, you even know my name?
:'''Gallagher:''' Of course I do! You folks are from the legendary Astral Express, and honorable guests of the Watchmaker.
:'''Gallagher:''' I had an encounter with this {{MC|м=gentleman|ж=lady}} in the Golden Hour. I remember that little silver-haired girl was there too...
:'''Gallagher:''' ...I'm sorry for what happened to that kid.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That's exactly what The Family has ordered us to investigate.
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} We are sorry too...
:'''Himeko:''' This is also the reason why we've come to visit you, Mr. Gallagher. The Express can't just overlook the death of that child, so we've decided to help The Family get to the bottom of it, in the hopes of getting justice for her.
:{{tx}}
;(Unused &mdash; FinishMission)
