:'''Principled Bloodhound Family Member:''' Apologies. The Bloodhound Family is running an investigation up ahead. No unauthorized personnel allowed.
::'''Principled Bloodhound Family Member:''' ...Hold on a minute. I think I've seen you before, the gray-haired one.
::'''March 7th:''' ...How much trouble have you stirred up exactly on Penacony?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} This ain't it, chief. You've got the wrong {{MC|ж=gal|м=guy}}.
:::'''Principled Bloodhound Family Member:''' Not possible! It was you the last time, yelling about some clockwork friendship while beating me up with that silver-haired girl!
:::That's right! It's-a-me, Clockie!
:::'''March 7th:''' ...You think you look alike?
:::How about a clockwork trick?
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} That's right! It's-a-me, Clockie!
:::'''March 7th:''' ...You think you look alike?
:::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} How about a clockwork trick?
::'''March 7th:''' ...Wait, are you for real?
::'''Principled Bloodhound Family Member:''' Not possible! It was you the last time, yelling about some clockwork friendship while beating me up with that silver-haired girl!
::'''March 7th:''' ...
::'''Himeko:''' ...
::'''Principled Bloodhound Family Member:''' I'm not letting you get by this time... Please leave, or I'll have to get on my knees and beg you!
::'''March 7th:''' (Trailblazer), what kind of heinous crime have you committed now...
::'''Himeko:''' Hold on, Sir... We have documents authorized by The Family that would aid your investigation. If it wouldn't trouble you, could we see this Mr. Gallagher?
::'''Principled Bloodhound Family Member:''' Who exactly is this Gallagher you keep talking about? There have been a few people mentioning this name, even the one with the gray hair.
::'''March 7th:''' Uh? He didn't send you all here?
::'''Principled Bloodhound Family Member:''' It was the Security Officer who dispatched us. That's all I can divulge.
::'''March 7th:''' He'll do! He's the one we've been looking for!
::'''Principled Bloodhound Family Member:''' Sorry, no can do. The boss said that since it's a matter of The Family's reputation, no one's allowed through.
::'''Principled Bloodhound Family Member:''' Everyone, please leave. There's really no need for us to make things difficult for each other, right?
::'''Himeko:''' We're really sorry for troubling you. (Trailblazer), March, let's think of another way.
::'''March 7th:''' Another way... That's it! Didn't (Trailblazer) say something about that... What was it... clockwork? That got this guy to change his mind.
::'''March 7th:''' Can you perform it again, (Trailblazer)? That... Clockie magic!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} Just what I've been waiting for!
::{{Диалог|Стрелка}} But I can't abuse it for evildoings.
:::'''March 7th:''' It's not bad if we're resolving a misunderstanding!
::'''March 7th:''' Please, (Trailblazer)!
::{{tx}}
